+#
+# The CSRC-standard related-party note prints its allowance beside every balance rather than
+# beneath the block:
+#
+#     项目名称 | 关联方 |     期末余额     |     期初余额
+#                       | 账面余额 | 坏账准备 | 账面余额 | 坏账准备
